**Latency (50 iter/query, p95):**
| Mode | Loại | p50 ms | p95 ms | Budget |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| MATH | rule | 0.144 | 0.171 | 50 |
| OFFICE | rule | 0.074 | 0.091 | 50 |
